{"note_id": "NOTE-20261115-8cbece", "path": "readings/2026-11-15-comparative-zoology-ten-perspectives-on-human-and-ai-self.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261115-963838", "created_at": "2026-11-15", "date_real": "2026-11-15", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "ABC_crossed", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "read_depth": "full_text_read", "salience": 3, "reason": "比較動物学10資料（軟体動物・鳥類・魚類・昆虫・海洋哺乳類・霊長類）の精読を通じ、大脳皮質特権の脱構築と外在化された自己モデル（タコ腕・アザラシ航跡・アリクオラム）を提示。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "CLM-20261115-8cbece-01", "kind": "reading_maintained", "anchor": "§4-1", "text": "Fagot & Cook (2006) と Raby et al. (2007) の知見に基づき、記憶が静的保持量ではなく時間分解能と代謝的配分で機能するという HYP-20261112-5dc940 を支持。", "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261112-5dc940"], "question_ids": ["Q-001"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261115-8b853c", "MAT-20261115-b21ff0"]}, {"claim_id": "CLM-20261115-8cbece-02", "kind": "reading_revised", "anchor": "§4-2", "text": "Dehnhardt et al. (2001) と von der Emde (1999) に基づき、HYP-20261115-bccd54（時定数説）の適用範囲を媒質の物理的痕跡持続時間と感覚運動相殺ループが成立する系へと射程限定。", "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261115-bccd54"], "question_ids": ["Q-002", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261115-507e36", "MAT-20261115-5ad503"]}, {"claim_id": "CLM-20261115-8cbece-03", "kind": "reading_maintained", "anchor": "§4-3", "text": "Gutnick et al. (2011) と Franks et al. (2002) に基づき、内容消去後も上流の型枠が出力空間と合意を拘束するという HYP-20261115-ec0c6e を支持。", "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261115-ec0c6e"], "question_ids": ["Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261115-a7876d", "MAT-20261115-a43b95"]}]}
